<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1044] bin/mahout throws NoClassDefFoundError: org/apache/hadoop/util/ProgramDriver</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1044</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;bin/mahout throws NoClassDefFoundError: org/apache/hadoop/util/ProgramDriver&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I think this is due to line 224&lt;br/&gt;
    CLASSPATH=&quot;${CLASSPATH}:${MAHOUT_HOME/lib/hadoop/*}&quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I fix the issue by moving the closing brace&lt;br/&gt;
    CLASSPATH=&quot;${CLASSPATH}:${MAHOUT_HOME}/lib/hadoop/*&quot;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;Ubuntu 12.04&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
